## Projects

### NutritionTracker - Macro Tracker Application

**Live Demo:** [https://macro-tracker-27.preview.emergentagent.com/auth](https://macro-tracker-27.preview.emergentagent.com/auth)

#### Description
NutritionTracker is a fullstack web application designed to help users track their nutrition and achieve their health goals. This comprehensive macro tracking tool enables users to monitor their daily nutritional intake and maintain a balanced diet.

#### Features
- **User Authentication:** Secure login and registration system with email and password
- **Nutrition Tracking:** Track your daily macronutrients (proteins, carbohydrates, fats)
- **Goal Setting:** Set and achieve personalized nutrition goals
- **User Dashboard:** Monitor your progress and view nutritional statistics
- **Responsive Design:** Clean and modern UI built with modern web technologies

#### Technology Stack
- Frontend: Modern web framework with responsive design
- Backend: Fullstack application with user authentication
- Database: User data management and storage
- Deployment: Hosted on Emergent Agent platform

#### How It Works
1. Users create an account or log in to their existing account
2. Set personalized nutrition goals based on their health objectives
3. Track daily food intake and macronutrient consumption
4. Monitor progress through intuitive dashboards and reports
5. Adjust diet plans based on tracked data and goal progress

